msgstr "Diş paketleri"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:76
msgid ""
"Dental tourism packages in Istanbul — personalised, not one-size-fits-all"
msgstr "İstanbul'da diş turizmi paketleri — kişiye özel, hazır paket değil"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:77
msgid ""
"Dental work is more than a Hollywood smile. Your package is built around a "
